    <!-- Developer connection for ADB debugging -->
    <string name="dev_link_title">Kgokahano ya bahlahisi</string>
    <string name="dev_link_body">E bontsha dikenyo le diapp tsohle tsa TV, e fetola kenyo ho di-TV tse sa arabeng dikonopo tsa HDMI, mme e beha kganya ho tse ding. E sebetsa ka kgokahano ya debugging (ADB) ya TV. Dikonopo le ho ngola di sebetsa ka tsela e tshwanang ntle le yona.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_step_developer">Ho TV, bula Settings › System › About mme o kgethe Android TV OS build makgetlo a supileng. Ho di-TV tsa kgale ke Device Preferences › About › Build.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_step_debugging">Bula Developer options, haufi le About, mme o bulele USB debugging. Ho Shield ke Network debugging.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_step_allow">Tobetsa Hokela, ebe ho TV o tshwaya Always allow mme o kgethe OK.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_connect">Hokela</string>
    <string name="dev_link_allow">Dumella ho TV</string>
    <string name="dev_link_allow_body">Tshwaya Always allow from this computer, ebe OK</string>
    <string name="dev_link_turn_off">Tima</string>
    <string name="dev_link_off">E timile. E eketsa dikenyo le diapp tsohle</string>
    <string name="dev_link_away">TV ha e arabe. App e leka hape ka bo yona ha rimoto e ntse e bulehile.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_away_short">Ha e arabe</string>
    <string name="dev_link_debugging_off">TV e hanne kgokahano. Hlahloba hore USB debugging e bulehile. Ho tloha Android TV 14 di-TV tse ding di amohela Wireless debugging feela, eo TennaRC e sa kgoneng ho e sebedisa hajwale.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_debugging_off_short">Debugging e timile ho TV</string>
    <string name="dev_link_wireless">Ke Wireless debugging feela e bulehileng, eo TennaRC e sa kgoneng ho e sebedisa hajwale. Bulela le USB debugging, kapa o kopanye hanngwe ho tswa khomputareng mme o tsamaise adb tcpip 5555, e tla sebetsa ho fihlela TV e qala botjha.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_wireless_short">Ke Wireless debugging feela e bulehileng</string>
    <string name="dev_link_not_allowed">Ha ho ya e dumelletseng ho TV. Leka hape, mme o kgethe OK moo.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_not_allowed_short">Ha e a dumellwa ho TV</string>
    <string name="dev_link_forgotten">TV e lebetse fono ena, jwalo ka ha Android TV e etsa ka sesebediswa seo e sa kang ya se bona beke. Leka hape, mme o e dumelle ho TV.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_forgotten_short">TV e lebetse fono ena</string>
